                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Part of reproductive justice means ending disparities in maternal healthcare outcomes in the U.S.\n\nThat\u2019s why I cosponsored the Black Maternal Health Momnibus Act to begin fighting to end preventable maternal mortality, maternal healthcare disparities, & more.",
