                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Alaskans know the importance of choice and preserving the right to choose what we do and do not do with our bodies. It\u2019s time that Alaska understanding be part of what determines the national standard. It\u2019s time to protect reproductive healthcare nationwide.",
