                "retweet_count": 28,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This campaign has always been pro-freedom and, by extension, pro-choice. That\u2019s why I\u2019m excited to announce being endorsed by the Juneau Pro-Choice Coalition! Together, we will continue fighting for reproductive healthcare for all Alaskans and all Americans nationwide. https://t.co/aPHVPZqH2b",
