                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Alaska\u2019s problems have solutions! I\u2019ve cosponsored legislation like the Women\u2019s Health Protection Act because I will always defend our right to reproductive healthcare - I\u2019m pro-freedom, after all. As long as I am in office, Alaska will always be a reliable vote for choice. https://t.co/VF25g8npJI",
