                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 27,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Part of being pro-freedom is making sure that women have the freedom to choose when they do or do not start and grow their families. \n\nProtecting our right to reproductive healthcare has been my priority from day one. That\u2019s why I am honored to receive an endorsement from Emily\u2019s List.\n\nThey know, like me, the importance of preserving our right to choose. As the only major pro-choice candidate in this race, I will continue to work with them and others to make sure that right isn\u2019t eroded or eliminated for Alaskans and Americans nationwide.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
