                "source": "Loomly",
                "text": "The right to choose is under attack nationwide and millions are facing the reality of seeing their ability to access reproductive healthcare be restricted or banned outright. It\u2019s never been more important for Alaska to have a pro-choice vote in the House of Representatives.",
