                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 46,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Too many Alaskan veterans face challenges accessing crucial resources like healthcare, mental health support, and employment opportunities. The vast distances and unique needs of our state further exacerbate these issues.\n\n\u00a0Veterans deserve not to have to worry about their basic needs once they\u2019ve come home after fighting to keep our country safe. I\u2019ve been fighting hard to tackle food insecurity for veterans, get them better access to assisted living services and housing they need, and more.\u00a0\n\nIt\u2019s what our veterans deserve, and it's what I\u2019ll continue to get them.",
